mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942240/extras/0722ccec640d85e7555df95c3e5bcaa7.poster.avif?t=1771186124\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942240/extras/0722ccec640d85e7555df95c3e5bcaa7.webm?t=1771186124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942240/extras/0722ccec640d85e7555df95c3e5bcaa7.mp4?t=1771186124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At sunset, powerful storms hit the island and cover it in a poisonous mist. The world reveals new secrets under the darkness, some beneficial, some terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while it may be tempting to spend time underneath the twilight, the longer you stay the more violent the world becomes, bringing forth tornadoes, stronger enemies and slowly ripping apart the very island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactics Meets Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can be tough. But with dozens of unique elements and status effects that can combine and interact with each other there are countless ways in which to tackle the various challenges you will encounter. Whether you choose to immolate enemies, fling them in the air or slow them down, stun them or simply make them slip on ice, there is always a way to deal with even the toughest challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on discord. The game is still in an early development stage. We would love to have you play it and build it with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ludix Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942240/857ffe489f93a70488695f25739d707ea5a4f642/header.jpg?t=1771186124","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirem